Subject: [PATCH] fattn: fused tile dequantization also for q8_0 KV (kvq 0/1/2;
 same flag GGML_CUDA_FATTN_TILE_Q4)

Head size 256, q8_0/q8_0, <= 16 query columns. test-backend-ops: same pass/fail pattern as default; 4 columns kv 113408: 2053 -> 1433 us; 1 column unchanged (vector kernel already good).
STRIX MTP n3 at 113k with q8_0 KV: 43.92 -> 50.29 t/s (mode 1), identical output hash.
